data: {"id": "848714f350c44bcc-thinking-parallel_evidence-633", "run_id": "848714f350c44bcc", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "根据已采集的真实证据，结论如下：\n\n## 实体确认\n- **Pod**: `aiops-case-01/workload-68c557d875-gtzc8` (UID `840e1f30-952d-4886-9edd-e96097582f87`)\n- **控制器**: Deployment `workload` → ReplicaSet `workload-68c557d875` → Pod\n- **创建时间**: 2026-09-10T10:19:45Z，截至采集时 **19 分钟**，状态仍为 **Pending**\n\n## 候选原因验证\n\n### 1. Node Affinity/Selector 不匹配 → **确认**\n- Pod YAML 中 `nodeSelector: {\"aiops.lab/unavailable\": \"true\"}`\n- describe 中 scheduler 报错: `0/3 nodes are available: 3 node(s) didn't match Pod's node affinity/selector`\n- **3 个 Node", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1789036784717, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

