data: {"id": "848714f350c44bcc-final", "run_id": "848714f350c44bcc", "seq": 638, "ts_ms": 1789036799142, "status": "success", "answer": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-01/workload-68c557d875-gtzc8` | Pending | Pod 配置了 `nodeSelector: {aiops.lab/unavailable: 'true'}`，但集群中所有节点（master, node1, node2）均未设置该标签，导致调度器无法找到匹配节点。 |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s State | `pod.status` | `status: \"Pending\"`, `phase: \"Pending\"`, `PodScheduled: False` | 确认 Pod 调度失败的直接症状。 |\n| 2 | K8s Event | `event.message` | `0/3 nodes are available: 3 node(s) didn't match Pod's node affinity/selector.` | 明确调度失败的机制为节点标签选择器匹配失败。 |\n| 3 | K8s Config | `container.resource_request.cpu/memory` | `cpu: 5m`, `memory: 8Mi` | 确认资源请求值极低，排除因资源不足导致无节点可调度的可能性。 |\n| 4 | K8s Event | `event.message` (fact-81a316787322) | `19m` 时的 `FailedScheduling` 事件记录 | 提供故障持续时间与事件发生的历史锚点。 |\n\n**证据交叉印证：**\n1. **配置与症状匹配**：证据 1 和 2 结合证实，Pod 处于 Pending 状态且无法调度。\n2. **排除资源因素**：证据 3 提供的极小资源请求（5m CPU）排除了节点资源耗尽的可能性，指向调度逻辑或策略配置问题。\n3. **逻辑闭环**：事件中的错误信息明确指出了 `affinity/selector` 不匹配，与已知的 Pod 配置（`nodeSelector: {aiops.lab/unavailable: 'true'}`）完全对应。由于 Pod 尚未启动，Logging 和 Tracing 维度无数据。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\nPod 配置了未存在于集群节点的 nodeSelector 标签 → 调度器无法找到满足亲和性/选择器条件的节点 → FailedScheduling 事件持续生成 → Pod 状态保持 Pending，无法进入 Scheduling/Running 阶段。\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n**已确认的根因**：Pod 的 `nodeSelector` 配置 (`aiops.lab/unavailable: 'true'`) 与集群实际节点标签状态不一致。\n\n*   **证据支撑**：\n    *   **E1 (K8s Event)**：调度器报告 `3 node(s) didn't match Pod's node affinity/selector`。\n    *   **E2 (K8s State)**：Pod 处于 `Pending` 状态且 `PodScheduled` 为 `False`。\n    *   **E3 (K8s Config)**：资源请求极低，证明失败并非由资源分配瓶颈引起，而是纯粹的策略匹配失败。\n\n该根因由官方诊断逻辑提供且证据充分，现象与配置偏差具有直接的因果关系。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 1.2m\n├─ 问题定位: 26.3s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 37.9s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-01/workload-68c557d875-gtzc8: 37.9s (Evidence 32.6s, RCA 5.2s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 9.1s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-01/workload-68c557d875-gtzc8**: pod-pending-unschedulable\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 73.248, "metrics": {"run_id": "848714f350c44bcc", "mttr": {"value": "1.2m", "seconds": 73.25311923027039, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "42%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-pending-unschedulable", "pass": true, "score": 0.9333, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.3}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.6666666666666666, "weighted_score": 0.1333}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.7, "weighted_score": 0.14, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "部分因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.15, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "核心: pod-pending-unschedulable"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.5, "weighted_score": 0.1, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "detail": "来源: layer_confidence, 分数: 50%"}], "confidence_penalties": [], "evidence_breakdown": {"total": 0, "breakdown": {}}, "performance": {"total_duration_ms": 73253.11923027039, "llm_calls": 14, "llm_duration_ms": 69352.43463516235, "tool_calls": 16, "executed_tool_calls": 13, "deduplicated_tool_calls": 2, "successful_tool_calls": 15, "failed_tool_calls": 1, "tool_duration_ms": 10997.514486312866, "tool_wall_duration_ms": 3550.459146499634}, "nodes": {"layer": {"name": "问题定位", "duration_ms": 26273.24938774109, "success": true}, "parallel_evidence": {"name": "并发证据采集", "duration_ms": 37890.10977745056, "success": true}, "evidence": {"name": "evidence", "duration_ms": 0.0, "success": true}, "rca": {"name": "rca", "duration_ms": 0.0, "success": true}, "conclusion": {"name": "汇总总结", "duration_ms": 9068.026304244995, "success": true}}, "success": true, "errors": []}}

